- op: discuss  # 3d01
  at: '2026-11-03T17:35:34Z'  # 3d01
  by: agent  # 3d01
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 3d01
  clock: 3  # 3d01
  nonce: 3d01  # 3d01
  message: "TRACED 2026-11-03 (dev cd6aeed541; fixture under the session scratchpad, reproducible from this note). (1) Which pass: the tier filter at the default max_tier 3. supply_chain.classify_file on knex lib/dialects/index.js returns DERIVED 4, reason 'detected as minified/generated' (the content heuristic; index.ts beside it is FIRST_PARTY 1 by the lib/ path rule). (2) Why the edges survive: cli.py's _is_valid_edge_src inside the tier-filter block keeps an edge by the SHAPE of its src id, not by membership in the surviving node set. Two arms: the documented file-level carve-out (':file' in the id) keeps the 26 file-level edges; the 'defensive fallback' marked pragma no cover ('unlikely path') returns True for any src containing .py: .js: .ts: .tsx: or .jsx:, which is every symbol-level source in those languages, and it is what keeps the getDialectByNameOrAlias edge. Fixture: lib/app.min.js (tier 4) with a function pick calling lib/helpers.js helper, plus require('./helpers'); default survey removes all three app.min.js nodes and keeps all three of its out-edges, then boundary synthesis mints javascript:lib/app.min.js:0-0:file:external_symbol AND javascript:lib/app.min.js:0-0:pick:external_symbol as sources (tier 3, kind external_symbol). So for py/js/ts/tsx/jsx the src half of the tier filter is vacuous. (3) The reading conflict: ADR-0043 section 4 says 'Boundary nodes are minted only for endpoints that survive filtering, so the post-filter dangling-source class is closed by construction', which is this invariant's statement. a04ea91b99 (WI-pozur) closed the class the other way, by minting a boundary FOR the removed file's id, and test_phase_de_reorder.py G2 test_pb2_import_srcs_resolved pins that behaviour; META-sigap's 10-25 premise check counts it as the fixed source half. The two readings cannot both hold; the owner decides. If this invariant's reading stands, the cure is membership (src in filtered_symbol_ids), deleting the fallback, measuring first which analyzers emit file-level edges without a file node, and rewriting G2 to assert the derived file's edges are gone."  # 3d01
